in stack traces.

Export sprint_backtrace() and sprint_backtrace_build_id() as GPL symbols
so the test module can exercise the backtrace APIs.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-4-6
Signed-off-by: Sasha Levin <sashal@kernel.org>
